            <script type="application/ld+json">
                  {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is life insurance and how does it work?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>A life insurance policy is a contract between a policyholder and the insurance company. Here the policyholder is liable to pay the assigned premiums in a specified schedule for a specific period. Against the premiums paid, the nominee(s) is entitled to get an assured lump sum as a death benefit if the life assured dies within a <a href=\"/life-insurance-guide/term/what-is-policy-term-meaning.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">policy term</a>.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "When should I buy a life insurance policy? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>The ideal time<sup>[17] </sup>to buy life insurance varies from person to person. Usually, it may be beneficial to get life insurance if you have dependents or you’re in crucial stages of your life like marriage, childbirth, or starting a business. Experts believe purchasing life insurance is more beneficial when you are young, as the premiums are lower.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the key benefits of life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>The key <a href=\"/term-insurance-plans/term-plan-with-return-of-premium.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">benefits of life insurance</a> are:</p><ul><li>Life insurance offers a lump sum coverage amount to the nominee upon the life assured’s death, which may financially cushion the family from unforeseen crises.</li><li>Premiums of life insurance are relatively low and cost-effective when bought early in life.</li><li>Life insurances with maturity benefits provide fixed returns, which are guaranteed<sup>* </sup>savings.</li><li>Coverage can be enhanced through optional riders which come at an additional nominal rate.</li><li>Premium payments are subject to tax deductions (in case of old tax regime), while death and maturity benefits are tax-free (subject to satisfaction of conditions mentioned therein). Additionally, health-related riders offer tax deductions too (in case of old tax regime).</li><li>Loan facility is available against the policy.</li></ul>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much coverage amount do I need? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>The coverage amount should base on individual needs and targets. According to experts<sup>[19]</sup>, a coverage of at least 10 times your current annual income may be a good amount to financially secure your loved ones in your absence.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I choose the right sum assured for life insurance? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>To choose the right sum assured for life insurance<sup>[20]</sup>, you may identify your goals, calculate and add up the monthly family expenses, liabilities like outstanding loans or debts, and funds needed to fulfil goals like a child’s education, marriage, or spouse’s retirement corpus, and deduct from it the value of your existing wealth. A <a href=\"/life-insurance-plans.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">life insurance coverage</a> calculator may be helpful.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a life insurance premium? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>A <a href=\"/life-insurance-guide/life/life-insurance-premium.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">life insurance premium</a><sup>[21]</sup> is the amount of money payable on a specified schedule to keep the policy active.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much premium will I have to pay? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>How much premium one may pay depends on<sup>[16]</sup> his/her age, gender, health, family medical history, lifestyle, smoking, and driving habits etc. It also depends on the preferred coverage and policy tenure.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a life insurance quote? ",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>A life insurance quote is the amount payable for the policy.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who should consider purchasing life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Those who<sup>[22]</sup> have dependents like a spouse, parents, or children, may consider purchasing life insurance.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the different types of life insurance plans?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Following are the different types<sup>[18]</sup> of <a href=\"/life-insurance-plans.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">life insurance plans</a> available.</p><ul><li>Term plan</li><li>ULIP</li><li><a href=\"/life-insurance-guide/investments/endowment-policy.html\">Endowment policy</a></li><li>Whole life policy</li><li>Money back policy</li><li><a href=\"/retirement-pension-plans.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pension Plan</a> etc.</li></ul>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What factors impact the premium of a life insurance policy?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>The premium of a life insurance policy is affected by the coverage and tenure of the policy as well as the life assured’s details like age, gender, income, health, family medical records, lifestyle, smoking, and driving habits.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I file a life insurance claim?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>To file a <a href=\"/life-insurance-claim-assistance.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">life insurance claim</a><sup>[18]</sup>, i.e., the death claim, the assignee or nominee should send a claim intimation to the insurer as early as possible , it should contain the date, place, and cause of death. Afterwards, a filled-up claim form, death certificate, original policy document, deeds of assignment/reassignment, legal document in case of no specified nominee, and discharge certificate executed and witnessed need to be submitted when the insurance company asks for documents.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which types of death are typically not covered by life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>A life insurance policy may not cover deaths in the following cases<sup>[16]</sup>:</p><ul class=\"with_dots\"><li>Death due to risky activities like adventure sports, rash driving or car racing, and certain hazardous jobs like mining, firefighting, construction work, piloting, police work, or oil rig work. Insurances can be availed in these cases but at much higher premiums.</li><li>Murder in which the beneficiary is involved somehow.</li><li>Suicide within two years of the policy issuance.</li></ul>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the main uses of life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>The main uses of life insurance<sup>[21]</sup> are to financially protect your loved ones if you are no more and help you save taxes while you pay for it. The lump sum amount paid to the nominee as the death benefit can be utilised to help the family sustain its lifestyle, pay off debts, and fund life goals like the child’s education or marriage or the spouse’s retirement corpus. Meanwhile, you can earn tax benefits while you purchase a policy and pay its premiums.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is meant by life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Life insurance is a contract between you and the insurance company. You pay a fixed amount regularly, called a premium. In return, the company promises to give a lump sum to your family if something happens to you. Some plans also give you money if you live through the policy term. It helps protect your loved ones financially when you are not around.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How to claim life insurance?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>In order to make a claim on a life insurance policy, the nominee must notify the insurer about the death of the insured. The nominee must also submit documents such as the death certificate, the policyholder's ID proof, and a claim form. Once all of the documents have been verified, the insurance company will complete and process the claim and provide the death benefit based on the option that was exercised in the policy.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is changing?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Our company name is changing from Bajaj Allianz Life Insurance Company Ltd. to Bajaj Life Insurance Ltd. (formerly known as Bajaj Allianz Life Insurance Company Ltd.).</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Why has the name changed?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>This change reflects Bajaj Group’s renewed focus on strengthening its identity under the Bajaj name – one of India’s most trusted brands – while keeping our customer-first promise intact.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will this affect my existing policy?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>No. Your policy terms, benefits, premiums, and renewals remain unchanged. This is purely a name change and does not affect your policy in any way.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will my service experience change?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>No. All your service touchpoints – branches, app, website, call centre, and relationship managers – remain the same.</p><p>Please note: The website URL, call centre number, and other communication details will be updated to reflect the new name – Bajaj Life Insurance Ltd. You can continue to use the existing touchpoints until the transition is fully complete.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need to update my policy documents?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>No. When policies renew or new ones are issued, they will reflect the new name.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will Allianz continue as a partner?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Allianz has decided to exit in line with their overall India strategy, and after this acquisition, our 100% equity will be owned by Bajaj Group.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will there be new products or benefits?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Your current benefits remain unchanged. We will continue to innovate and launch solutions to serve you better.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": " Will there be any changes in the touchpoints?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "<p>Yes. All our touchpoints — including our website (<a href=\"https://www.bajajlifeinsurance.com/\">www.bajajlifeinsurance.com</a>), Customer Care No (020-6712 1212), email (<a href=\"mailto:customercare@bajajlife.com\">customercare@bajajlife.com</a>), and mobile app (Bajaj Life Insurance App) — have been updated. You can continue to engage with us seamlessly through these platforms.</p>"
      }
    }
  ]
}
            </script> 
      
      
         
      

                  
    

      


