                          <a href="/life-insurance-guide/life/what-is-life-insurance.html">
                          <p class="h5">What Is Life Insurance?</p>
                          </a>
                        </div>  
                        <div class="box-details">
                          <p>A life insurance policy is a legal contract between the insurer (Insurance provider) and an individual (policyholder). </p>
