  <!-- <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha512-z3gLpd7yknf1YoNbCzqRKc4qyor8gaKU1qmn+CShxbuBusANI9QpRohGBreCFkKxLhei6S9CQXFEbbKuqLg0DA==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" /> -->
 <div id="cust" class="customer_speaks scroll-cont">
     <div class="customer-speaks-main-heading" style="display:block;">
<div class="customer-speaks-top-svg">
  </div>
  <div class="h4 main-heading">Customer Speaks</div>
  </div>

  
 
<div class="customer-speaks scroll_div">
  
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Cooperative and Helpful</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">My Certificate of Entitlement (COE) was pending, so I visited your branch and requested its completion. The officer in charge immediately completed all the formalities within minutes. I’m happy that the staff was very cooperative and helpful. Wishing him all the success. Thank you.
</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/ram-singh-chauhan.png" alt="  Ram Singh Chauhan" title="  Ram Singh Chauhan"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">  Ram Singh Chauhan</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Customer First Approach</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">I had an excellent experience at the Bajaj Life branch. The staff were extremely courteous, transparent, and supportive throughout the process. Their professionalism and kindness made the entire experience smooth and reassuring. I truly appreciate their customer-first approach.
</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/aniket-ramteke.png" alt="  Aniket Ashok Ramteke" title="  Aniket Ashok Ramteke"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">  Aniket Ashok Ramteke</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Timely Returns</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">Excellent and timely tax-free returns. It is worth investing in this company’s life insurance policies, which also provide life cover, unlike fixed deposits (FDs) that attract tax on returns and can be financially risky. FD interest is uncertain, whereas returns from these insurance products are stable and involve minimal risk.
</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/chellam-rajeswaran.png" alt="  Chellam  Rajeswaran" title="  Chellam  Rajeswaran"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">  Chellam  Rajeswaran</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Very Satisfied</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">As on today I am very much satisfied. I am getting survival benefit without fail every month before the last day of month. I have confidence i will get  same further remaining amount till my account clear.
</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/mahadev-pukale.png" alt="  Mahadev Subhash Pukale" title="  Mahadev Subhash Pukale"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">  Mahadev Subhash Pukale</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Money Back Policy</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">The best plan that I availed in my life. Awesome services provided during plan. This was money back policy and I received money in bank on time automatically as well as matured amount too. Thank you Bajaj Life.</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/person-icon.svg" alt="Mrs. Santushti  Gupta" title="Mrs. Santushti  Gupta"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">Mrs. Santushti  Gupta</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Simple and Stress Free</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">A consultant who truly cares! Clear guidance, smart solutions, and reliable support, making insurance simple and stress-free. Highly recommended for anyone seeking trusted advice.</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/person-icon.svg" alt="Mr. Bhupendra Patel" title="Mr. Bhupendra Patel"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">Mr. Bhupendra Patel</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Very Good</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">My experience is very good and company is very good explaining everything well and any kind of problem always trying to be there. Thank you Bajaj Life....👍</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
                 <img loading="lazy" src="/content/dam/balic-web/images/customer-speaks/person-icon.svg" alt="Koustav Adak" title="Koustav Adak"/> 
          </div>
          <div class="cust-name-job">
            <div class="bottom-cust-name">Koustav Adak</div>
            <div class="bottom-cust-job"></div>
            <div class="rating-value h1">5</div>
          </div>
        </div>
          
      </div>
    
      <div class="testimonials-list">
		
          <div class="text-testimonials">
              <div class="text-testimonials-heading">
            <div class="text-test-card-head">Polite and Supportive Staff</div>
            <div>
		<svg xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                <g opacity="0.2">
                  <path d="M20 40C31.0457 40 40 31.0457 40 20C40 8.95431 31.0457 0 20 0C8.95431 0 0 8.95431 0 20C0 31.0457 8.95431 40 20 40Z" fill="#517DB9"/>
                  <path d="M12.2853 27H16.1422L18.7137 21.4V13H11V21.4H14.8569L12.2853 27ZM22.5716 27H26.4284L29 21.4V13H21.2863V21.4H25.1431L22.5716 27Z" fill="white"/>
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-test-card-content">The experience with Bajaj call center executive was very pleasant. First of all the voice interactive menu is very simple and it is extremely easy to connect with executive. The wait period was nil. The executive was extremely polite and supportive. This is my third experience with this call center and every time they are outstanding. Keep it up.</div>
          </div>
          

        <div class="customer-information-testimonials">
          <div class="cust-image">
