</td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Emotional Wellness<br />
 </b>(Psychologists consultations)<b></b></p>
</td><td><p>1 consultation per month &#61;</p>
<p>12 consultations per year </p>
</td><td colspan="2"><p>Average cost per session &#61; ₹ 500</p>
